6502DOS V0.1.0
For the Commander X16
>>RUN CWD.COM
CWD []
CD .. E 0  [] E 0 
CD . E 0  [] E 0 
CD NOPE E 3  [] E 0 
CD HELLO.TXT E 3  [] E 0 
CD DOCS E 0  [DOCS] E 0 
FIND README.TXT README.TXT
OPEN LONG.TXT E 0 
FIND ..\HELLO.TXT HELLO.TXT
FIND .\LONG.TXT LONG.TXT
FIND \MANY\F01.TXT F01.TXT
FIND HELLO.TXT E 2 
CD ..\MANY\SUB.DIR\INNER E 0  [MANY\SUB.DIR\INNER] E 0 
FIND DEEP.TXT DEEP.TXT
FIND ..\..\F02.TXT F02.TXT
CD .. E 0  [MANY\SUB.DIR] E 0 
CD C:/MANY/./SUB.DIR/INNER/ E 0  [MANY\SUB.DIR\INNER] E 0 
CD \ E 0  [] E 0 
CD MANY/SUB.DIR/../../DOCS/. E 0  [DOCS] E 0 
GETCWD C: [DOCS]
GETCWD A: []
GETCWD A: E 15 
GETCWD E: []
GETCWD E: E 15 
CD A:\ E 15  [DOCS] E 0 
CD C:\ E 0  [] E 0 

>>